  "summary": [
    "将 GitHub 议题的标题和正文交给 quality 技能，按其规则生成 JSON 分流结果。该规则仅将提供了足够复现细节的系统性代码缺陷标为 OK，因此由用户自定义配置引起的问题不属于这一档。",
    "Use the quality skill’s rubric to turn a GitHub issue title and body into a JSON triage assessment. The rubric reserves an OK rating for reports of systemic code defects with enough detail to reproduce the problem, so issues arising from user-defined settings fall outside that rating."
